00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Speaker 1: I don't want to spend a ton of time&nbsp;
on this, but I have an example for you of what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:10.080
happens when you confront one of these right&nbsp;
