litter boxes in the bathrooms so that students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:25.800
who identify as animals can use the litter&nbsp;
box as their bathroom. It's made up. Didn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:31.260
