00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:44.220
Speaker 1: About.
Speaker 5: Children using litter boxes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:48.060
in schools. You know, there's there's. Oh, that's&nbsp;
not what I said. Okay, well, then tell me what you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.980
said. I heard the audio. So what? Yeah. So what I&nbsp;
was talking about is all the craziness going on in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.980 --> 00:01:01.500
our schools, and this is just one of them. And I&nbsp;
had a I had a parent and a student in the audience&nbsp;&nbsp;

